<title>USA: Vemco Acquisition completes tender for Bailey.</title>
<headline>Vemco Acquisition completes tender for Bailey.</headline>
<dateline>FRASER, Mich. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vemco Acquisition Corp said Monday it completed its cash tender offer for all Bailey Corp common shares at a price of $8.75 per share, net to the seller in cash, without interest.</p>
<p>The offer expired on August 23.</p>
<p>Vemco began the offer to purchase Bailey shares on June 11. As of 1800 EDT August 23, 5,249,405 shares of Bailey had been tendered and not withdrawn. The tendered shares comprise about 98 percent of Bailey's outstanding common stock, it added.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
